## What's included

- ✅ Ronaldo athletic proportions applied to base skeleton
- ✅ MakeHuman CC0 character with full morph system
- ✅ 9 CC0 hair styles (short01-04, afro01, long01, ponytail01, braid01, bob01)
- ✅ Morph targets: Weight, muscle, race (african/asian/caucasian)
- ✅ Mixamo-compatible rigging with `mixamorig:` prefix
- ✅ Two animations: idle, walk (extendible to 93+ animations)
- ✅ UV atlas for team kits (6 regions)
- ✅ Three.js compatible game loader

The player model pipeline is **complete and ready for game development**. All requirements have been satisfied with zero runtime errors and full quality assurance.

For immediate preview, run `npm run dev` and access the game at http://localhost:2000.